  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">European Endowment for Democracy engagement in Bosnia and Herzegovina 2025-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to support and strengthen independent media and civil society actors in Bosnia and Herzegovina, through rapid and flexible assistance to smaller civil society actors and media with limited capacity, with a particular focus on supporting youth- and/or women-led initiatives. The overall strategic objective is to promote sustainable democratic development, advocacy and respect for human rights in Bosnia and Herzegovina. Implementing partner is European Endowment for Democracy.</narrative>
  </description>
